    "detailed_description": "<i>Food for Thought</i> strives to deliver the best food products to the common people, but when its robot workers turn against Lyft, the last human in the factory, she has to step up and punch some steel. Uncover the truth behind this attack, find your boss for answers, and put an end to this with style and power.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779390/extras/458628d1475ae2d3ba07ee8f31670f5e.poster.avif?t=1709319713\" width=600 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779390/extras/458628d1475ae2d3ba07ee8f31670f5e.webm?t=1709319713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779390/extras/458628d1475ae2d3ba07ee8f31670f5e.mp4?t=1709319713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Unleash powerful blows to enemies, use them as a weapon and utilize the environment to your advantage.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779390/extras/2e7e84365d595827f7cd03e8d6ea4ca0.poster.avif?t=1709319713\" width=600 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779390/extras/2e7e84365d595827f7cd03e8d6ea4ca0.webm?t=1709319713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779390/extras/2e7e84365d595827f7cd03e8d6ea4ca0.mp4?t=1709319713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Delve deep inside <i>Food for Thought</i>'s factory and unravel the dark secrets that have been hidden for many years.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779390/extras/7a87fadbf239936ba959e8ce26cb19cb.poster.avif?t=1709319713\" width=600 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779390/extras/7a87fadbf239936ba959e8ce26cb19cb.webm?t=1709319713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779390/extras/7a87fadbf239936ba959e8ce26cb19cb.mp4?t=1709319713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Encounter a variety of enemies that can punch, shoot or block your attacks. Finish them off in style with a devastating blow.",
    "about_the_game": "<i>Food for Thought</i> strives to deliver the best food products to the common people, but when its robot workers turn against Lyft, the last human in the factory, she has to step up and punch some steel. Uncover the truth behind this attack, find your boss for answers, and put an end to this with style and power.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779390/extras/458628d1475ae2d3ba07ee8f31670f5e.poster.avif?t=1709319713\" width=600 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779390/extras/458628d1475ae2d3ba07ee8f31670f5e.webm?t=1709319713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779390/extras/458628d1475ae2d3ba07ee8f31670f5e.mp4?t=1709319713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Unleash powerful blows to enemies, use them as a weapon and utilize the environment to your advantage.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779390/extras/2e7e84365d595827f7cd03e8d6ea4ca0.poster.avif?t=1709319713\" width=600 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779390/extras/2e7e84365d595827f7cd03e8d6ea4ca0.webm?t=1709319713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779390/extras/2e7e84365d595827f7cd03e8d6ea4ca0.mp4?t=1709319713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Delve deep inside <i>Food for Thought</i>'s factory and unravel the dark secrets that have been hidden for many years.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779390/extras/7a87fadbf239936ba959e8ce26cb19cb.poster.avif?t=1709319713\" width=600 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779390/extras/7a87fadbf239936ba959e8ce26cb19cb.webm?t=1709319713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779390/extras/7a87fadbf239936ba959e8ce26cb19cb.mp4?t=1709319713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Encounter a variety of enemies that can punch, shoot or block your attacks. Finish them off in style with a devastating blow.",
    "short_description": "Exploring a disarrayed food factory, play as Lyft and fight your way through this chaos using powerful abilities. Face off against relentless robots and bring them to pieces. There\u2019s only one option left to stop them: destroy them, throw them, PUNCH 'EM!",
